{"about_the_game":"The Rewinder 2 is an action adventure game inspried by eastern methology. As the last known rewinder, you'll wield the powers of Sizhi god to explore disrrupted villages, dungeons and save people from their dreams. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/umbrella.gif?t=1748335918\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/\u5206\u5272\u56fe1_en.png?t=1748335918\" /></div><br>Explore our unique memory levels and puzzles. As the last known rewinder, use your ability to explore others' memory. Bring them out of nightmares. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/\u516c\u9e21\u5544\u5730.gif?t=1748335918\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/\u5206\u5272\u56fe2_en.png?t=1748335918\" /></div><br>A unique set of dungeons are waiting for you to explore. Collect different charms to get various bonuses and special abilities.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/\u9694\u7a7a\u79fb\u7269.gif?t=1748335918\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/\u5206\u5272\u56fe3_en.png?t=1748335918\" /></div><br>Through out your journey, you will meet all sorts of monsters and ghosts, hear their stories and be friends with them.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/240412_headportraits_trans.png?t=1748335918\" /></div>","achievements":{"highli