.jpg?t=1748335918","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/6a51662a9d80c7b89029383d69232ff117d767c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748335918","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>The Rewinder Series</h1><p></p><br><h1>Join Our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/shlr2_D.png?t=1748335918\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get more information about The Rewinder Series NOW!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The Rewinder 2 is an action adventure game inspried by eastern methology. As the last known rewinder, you'll wield the powers of Sizhi god to explore disrrupted villages, dungeons and save people from their dreams. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/umbrella.gif?t=1748335918\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/\u5206\u5272\u56fe1_en.png?t=1748335918\" /></div><br>Explore our unique memory levels and puzzles. As the last known rewinder, use your ability to explore others' memory. Bring them out of nightmares. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/\u516c\u9e21\u5544\u5730.gif?t=1748335918\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915490/extras/\u5206\u5272\u56fe2_en.png?t=1748335918\"